  "description": "MudBlazor for ExChart: a Chrome that draws the chart's toolbar (Chart Filters' range in MudBlazor's inputs, the axis switch, the reset and a download menu) and its context menu with MudBlazor's own controls; the Chart Dock, a panel beside or below the grid holding the charts made from its selection as tabs; and a stylesheet mapping ExChart's tokens onto the MudBlazor palette, the theme's Primary, Secondary and Tertiary leading the series. Ships at the same version as ExChart and depends on exactly that version.",
